    <title>胶片拍摄之巨星400</title>
    <url>/2026/02/20/SuperStar400/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th align="center"><img src="/images/film/r001-001.jpg" alt="胶片拍摄之巨星400 - 照片 1" width="2560" height="1707" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></th>
<th align="center"><img src="/images/film/r001-002.jpg" alt="胶片拍摄之巨星400 - 照片 2" width="2560" height="1707" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></th>
<th align="center"><img src="/images/film/r001-003.jpg" alt="胶片拍摄之巨星400 - 照片 3" width="2560" height="1707" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td align="center"><img src="/images/film/r001-007.jpg" alt="胶片拍摄之巨星400 - 照片 4" width="1707" height="2560" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></td>
<td align="center"><img src="/images/film/r001-010.jpg" alt="胶片拍摄之巨星400 - 照片 5" width="1707" height="2560" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></td>
<td align="center"><img src="/images/film/r001-017.jpg" alt="胶片拍摄之巨星400 - 照片 6" width="1707" height="2560" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></td>
